        </task>

        <task workspace="0in">
            <statement>
                <p>
                    <m>g</m> is a function defined on <m>[-1,7]</m> such that
                    <m>g(4) =3</m>, <m>AV_{[0,4]} = 0.5</m>, and <m>g</m> is not
