        <task workspace="0in">
            <statement>
                <p>
                    <m>h</m> is a function defined on <m>[-1,7]</m> such that
                    <m>h(2) = 5</m>, <m>h(4) = 3</m> and <m>AV_{[2,4]} = -2</m>.
                </p>

    <sidebyside widths="35% 35%">
                  <image>
                        <shortdescription>
                            A square grid between -2 and 8 to plot the function that meets the requirements (if possible).
                        </shortdescription>
                        <prefigure xmlns="https://prefigure.org" label="prefigure-1-3-7">
                            
                            <diagram dimensions="(250,250)" margins="5">
                                <coordinates bbox="[-4,-4,16,16]">
                                    <grid-axes spacings="((-4,1,16),(-4,1,16))" xlabel="x" ylabel="y" hticks="(-4,2,16)" vticks="(-4,2,16)"  
                                    decorations="no"/>
                                </coordinates>
                            </diagram>
                        </prefigure>
                    </image>
                    <image>
                        <shortdescription>
                            A square grid between -2 and 8 to plot the function that meets the requirements (if possible).
                        </shortdescription>
                        <prefigure xmlns="https://prefigure.org" label="prefigure-1-3-8">
                            
                            <diagram dimensions="(250,250)" margins="5">
                                <coordinates bbox="[-4,-4,16,16]">
                                    <grid-axes spacings="((-4,1,16),(-4,1,16))" xlabel="x" ylabel="y" hticks="(-4,2,16)" vticks="(-4,2,16)"  
                                    decorations="no"/>
                                </coordinates>
                            </diagram>
                        </prefigure>
                    </image>
                </sidebyside>            </statement>
                <solution component="aaa-soln">
                    <p>
                        If we must go through <m>(2,5)</m> 
                        and <m>(4,3)</m>, then the slope between them 
                        must be <m>AV_{[2,4]}=\frac{h(4)-h(2)}{4-2}=\frac{3-5}{2}=-1</m>, not <m>-2</m>. 
                        Problem!  This is not possible.
                    </p>
                </solution>
        </task>
    </activity>
</handout>